mdv.ui.guide=Stamina & Combat Guide
mdv.ui.guide_body=§6Stamina§f powers every weapon ability.~LINEBREAK~§7• Hold a weapon and §fuse (right click)§7 to trigger its ability.~LINEBREAK~§7• Stamina regenerates when you stop using abilities (slower while sprinting).~LINEBREAK~§7• Drink a §aStamina Tonic§7 to restore 50 instantly.~LINEBREAK~§7• A §6Medal of Valor§7 permanently raises max stamina by 20.~LINEBREAK~§7• Repair custom weapons on an anvil with §fTempered Steel§7.~LINEBREAK~§7• §fHeavy Crossbow§7: hold use to wind, release to fire.
