## Armory entries
mdv.desc.knight_longsword=§fA well balanced knightly blade.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~§e[Ability] Charge Slash§7~LINEBREAK~Dash forward, cutting every enemy in your path. Reduced damage taken while dashing.
mdv.desc.warhammer=§fA hammer heavy enough to crack walls.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~§e[Ability] Ground Slam§7~LINEBREAK~Leap up and crash down in a shockwave. Falling from higher hits harder; used mid-air it slams instantly. No fall damage.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~§e[Passive]§7 Regular hits knock enemies far back.
mdv.desc.battle_axe=§fA northern warrior's axe.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~§e[Ability] Whirlwind§7~LINEBREAK~Spin three times, cutting everything around you and causing §4Bleed§7.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~§e[Passive]§7 25% chance to cause Bleed on hit.
mdv.desc.halberd=§fA polearm that is spear and axe in one.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~§e[Ability] Piercing Thrust§7~LINEBREAK~Skewer every enemy in a 6.5 block line and drive them back.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~§e[Passive]§7 Hits push enemies away, keeping your distance.
mdv.desc.heavy_crossbow=§fA siege crossbow with a steel prod.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~§e[Charged Shot]§7~LINEBREAK~Hold use to wind, release to fire. A full draw is a critical hit (x1.25).~LINEBREAK~Uses Crossbow Bolts (+2 damage) or arrows.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~§e[Enchantments]§7 Quick Charge / Piercing / Multishot / Power.
mdv.desc.dagger=§fAn assassin's dagger.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~§e[Passive] Backstab§7~LINEBREAK~Hitting an enemy from behind deals double damage and causes Bleed.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~§e[Ability] Shadow Step§7~LINEBREAK~Leap backwards in a puff of smoke; invisible and fast for 3 seconds.
mdv.desc.morning_star=§fA spiked mace.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~§e[Passive]§7 20% chance to §eStun§7 on hit.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~§e[Ability] Stunning Blow§7~LINEBREAK~Within 5 seconds your next hit is a guaranteed 3 second stun + 6 bonus damage.
mdv.desc.javelin=§fA light spear made for throwing.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~§e[Throw]§7 Use to throw it. It drops where it lands so you can pick it up again.
mdv.desc.fire_pot=§fA clay pot filled with oil.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~§e[Throw]§7 Shatters on impact and sets nearby enemies ablaze.~LINEBREAK~Enable "fire spread" in settings to set the ground on fire.
mdv.desc.war_horn=§fA horn that echoes across the battlefield.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~§e[Rally]§7 Allies within 16 blocks gain Strength / Speed / Resistance (10s), tamed wolves gain Strength, nearby monsters are Weakened.
mdv.desc.stamina_tonic=§fA brew of herbs and honey.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~§7Restores 50 stamina and grants Regeneration.
mdv.desc.valor_medal=§fAwarded to knights of great deeds.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~§7Permanently raises max stamina by 20 (up to 200).
mdv.desc.primordial_blade=§dA blade of the first dawn, holding a power beyond comprehension.~LINEBREAK~§8Light from the day the world began flows over its lightless edge.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~§e[Ability] Primordial Circle§7~LINEBREAK~Unfold a vast magic circle beneath you, dragging and binding every enemy within 6 blocks to its centre. After a second the circle erupts, launching them skyward, and three crescent waves of light tear forward up to 16 blocks. Damage taken while casting is greatly reduced.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~§e[Passive] Rift§7~LINEBREAK~Hits have a 25% chance to burst a small circle under the target for bonus magic damage and §8Wither§7.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~§dUnbreakable.
